															<font face="Arial" size="1px">
																Enter all required information in CAPITAL LETTERS using BLACK ink. Mark all applicable boxes with an "X".
																<br/>Two copies MUST be filed with the BIR and one held by the Taxpayer.
															</font>
														</td>
														<td width="200" valign="center">
															<p><img src="../img/1801v2018_BarCode/1801v2018_p1.png" width="220" height="75px" /> </p>
														</td>
													</tr>
												</table>
											</td>
										</tr>
